 ## Language change in the app
 
 Through the language bottom sheet (`rn-craft` → `references/patterns.md`): save to MMKV, `i18n.changeLanguage`, UI
-updates without restart (except RTL direction changes). Tell the backend if it localises push or emails.
+updates without restart (except RTL direction changes).
+
+The backend learns the language two ways:
+
+- Every request sends `X-App-Locale` with the active language (set in the base query), so errors and messages come
+  back in it. The header does not change the saved profile on the server.
+- When the user picks a language, also update the profile (for example `PATCH /me { preferredLocale }`) so push and
+  email sent later use it. If the request fails, keep the local choice and retry the update later.
 
